{"id":"2011-RPR","predecessor":["2009-RPR"],"counts":{"changed":8,"same":22,"removed":1},"items":[{"status":"changed","key":"table-recorded-divisions","old_key":"table-recorded-divisions","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":0.963,"conf":"high","t":"table","path":[],"diff":[["=","Division | Requirements | Recorded/Tracked Newcomer | None – normally beginner, perhaps never competed | Recorded Junior | None – normally age-based | Recorded Masters | Check event rules - normally age-based + other requirements | Recorded All Star | Recommend at least 40 Advanced points – check event"],["-","rules, may have other requirements"],["+","rules"],["=","| Recorded Champions/Invitational/Pro | Check event rules - normally have specific requirements | Recorded"]]},{"status":"same","key":"table-tracked-divisions","old_key":"table-tracked-divisions","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":1.0,"conf":"high","t":"table","path":[]},{"status":"changed","key":"top~p1","old_key":"top~p1","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":0.639,"conf":"high","t":"para","path":[],"diff":[["=","This new structure and points recorded/tracked will be effective January 1,"],["-","2009."],["+","2011. With the increasing amount of competitors and often “uneven” numbers within a competition (i.e. more followers than leaders), it has been decided that the WSDC will recognize and award the Tier points based on the number of individual competitors. If within one competition there are Tier 1 amount of leaders but Tier 2 amount of followers, points will be awarded separately for leaders and followers in finals."],["=","This new point structure is from this date forward, and past points will not be affected. These Tiers are based solely on the number of competitors and not the size of the event. The Competitor's Points Registry is meant as a tool to assist both the Promoter and the Contestant."]]},{"status":"changed","key":"top~p2","old_key":"top~p2","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":0.932,"conf":"high","t":"para","path":[],"diff":[["=","Only current WSDC Registry Member Events for Jack & Jill competition results in the Points Registry Books for male/leader and female/follower competitors. The WSDC records points for: Juniors, Newcomer, Masters, All Star, and Champion/Pro/Invitational but do not necessarily consider them a \"level of dance\"."],["-","These divisions are recorded but do not require points to move into them (normally)."],["=","We track points for: Novice, Intermediate, and Advanced. Points will be tracked based on the tiers below determined by number of competitors and used to decide appropriate divisions or to move up. Please be sure to check every individual event rules regarding their requirements to dance in any division."]]},{"status":"same","key":"top~p3","old_key":"top~p3","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":1.0,"conf":"high","t":"para","path":[]},{"status":"same","key":"top~p4","old_key":"top~p4","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":1.0,"conf":"high","t":"para","path":[]},{"status":"changed","key":"top~p5","old_key":"top~p5","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":0.651,"conf":"high","t":"para","path":[],"diff":[["=","Points are recorded/tracked as follows: When"],["-","couples are not even, the “number of couples” is determined by the lowest"],["=","number of"],["-","dancers between leaders and followers."],["+","competitors is “uneven”, points will be recorded/tracked separately by leader/follower."],["=","The minimum number of couples"],["+","(even leaders & followers)"],["=","to make a contest eligible for recording/tracking is five (5)."]]},{"status":"changed","key":"table-tiers","old_key":"table-tiers","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":0.979,"conf":"high","t":"table","path":[],"diff":[["=","Tier / # of"],["-","Couples"],["+","Competitors"],["=","| 1st Place | 2nd Place | 3rd Place | 4th Place | 5th Place | Additional Tier 1 = 5-15 | 5 | 4 | 3 | 2 | 1 | 0 Tier 2 = 16-39 | 10 | 8 | 6 | 4 | 2 | 6 to 10th 1 pt Tier 3 = 40+ | 15 | 12 | 10 | 8 | 6 | 1 pt all finalists"]]},{"status":"changed","key":"top~p6","old_key":"top~p6","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":0.947,"conf":"high","t":"para","path":[],"diff":[["=","TIER 1 - 5 to 15"],["-","Couples"],["+","Competitors"],["=","(Could be run as a \"finals only\", or perhaps semi and final)"]]},{"status":"changed","key":"top~p7","old_key":"top~p7","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":0.952,"conf":"high","t":"para","path":[],"diff":[["=","TIER 2 – 16 to 39"],["-","Couples"],["+","Competitors"],["=","(Should at least be run as a semi/final, but could be prelim / semi / final)"]]},{"status":"changed","key":"top~p8","old_key":"top~p8","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":0.938,"conf":"high","t":"para","path":[],"diff":[["=","TIER 3 – 40+"],["-","Couples"],["+","Competitors"],["=","(With this number of competitors, should be 3 rounds – prelim / semi / final)"]]},{"status":"same","key":"s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications","old_key":"s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":1.0,"conf":"high","t":"heading","path":[]},{"status":"same","key":"s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications~p1","old_key":"s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications~p1","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":1.0,"conf":"high","t":"para","path":["s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications"]},{"status":"same","key":"s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications.1","old_key":"s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications.1","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":1.0,"conf":"high","t":"item","path":["s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications"]},{"status":"same","key":"s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications.2","old_key":"s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications.2","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim":1.0,"conf":"high","t":"item","path":["s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications"]},{"status":"same","key":"s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications.3","old_key":"s-frequently-asked-questions-further-clarifications.3","old_version":"2009-RPR","sim